'''Waterhazard'''{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/5/58/Hero_Time_Script_As_Recorded.pdf ''Hero Time'' Script As Recorded]|group = script}}{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/6c/Revenge_of_the_Swarm_Script_Final_Draft.pdf ''Revenge of the Storm'' Script Final Draft]|group = script|name = script}}{{Refn|Most end credits of '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' and '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''|group = credits}} is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of an [[Orishan]] from the planet [[Kiusana]]{{Refn|group = AP|name = Action}} in the [[Andromeda (Classic)|Andromeda Galaxy]].

==Appearance==
Waterhazard appears as a red [[Wikipedia:Mollusca|mollusk]]-like alien with green eyes and a grey mouth that does not move when he speaks. Behind his legs and on the top of his arms are small spikes that are grey, there are black spots on his shoulders and legs, and on his hands are portholes, which he uses to shoot water. Waterhazard also has four fingers with claws on them and a grey spike on each of his feet. His lower torso is grey with two spikes on the side of it.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Waterhazard now has four slitted eyes and also has eye-like patterns on his chest with crab-like features on his stomach which appear to be crab legs forming a ribcage (although they are not){{Refn|[[:File:Water Hazard Optical Illusion.png]]|group = Bandai|name = merch}}. He has much fewer black spots than before. His mouth has a line running through it, his hood looks a lot rougher than before, is bigger, and more hexagonal than before, and he now has what appear to be barnacle-like portholes on his shoulders, arms, legs, and hands, from which he shoots the water. Rather than circular shoulders, he now has shoulder pad-like armor above his arm with much fewer black markings. He also has three spikes on the back of his legs and seems to have cracks on his arms and shoulders. The red sections near his face are now shorter and seemingly connect to his head with silver wire-like sections. His fingers are sharper and resemble dactyls, the "moveable finger" of a crab pincer. He is taller and thinner, as well as his legs becoming much thinner. His overall armor is a darker shade of red, seemingly maroon, and his grey parts are now more violet.

Waterhazard wears the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]]/[[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on his chest.
